// sitemap.xml (531 URLs). Rules used:
//   - old last segment equals a current product slug -> that product
//   - exactly one current product slug starts with "<old segment>-" -> that product
//   - anything else (category pages, discontinued models) -> a product search
//     for the old page's own words, or the parent category's words
//   - top-level verticals and searches with no results -> /products
